{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your minion Dwarves love looting treasures but always fail. Now you have tons of enemies to deal with.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend your castle</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/43ea3a2d5c5c6700e0a5312da89fe10b.poster.avif?t=1761962630\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/43ea3a2d5c5c6700e0a5312da89fe10b.webm?t=1761962630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/43ea3a2d5c5c6700e0a5312da89fe10b.mp4?t=1761962630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use any means to defend your castle Walls, Dwarven shields, or throw dwarves at the problem; sometimes that can work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thousands of units on screen</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/a7d32c91f28be8ba3bb844aeaea7481f.poster.avif?t=1761962630\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/a7d32c91f28be8ba3bb844aeaea7481f.webm?t=1761962630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/a7d32c91f28be8ba3bb844aeaea7481f.mp4?t=1761962630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against thousands of enemies in real time. Can you handle them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your</strong> <strong>economy</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/19f214489fbd15cd8ed74a94ed3a64d9.poster.avif?t=1761962630\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/19f214489fbd15cd8ed74a94ed3a64d9.webm?t=1761962630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/19f214489fbd15cd8ed74a94ed3a64d9.mp4?t=1761962630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first step for a strong defense is a strong economy, as they say: a strong defense in a strong economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your city and upgrade your economy with mining, farming, and trading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Fights</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/e3ad061963032556819906e4163b0017.poster.avif?t=1761962630\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/e3ad061963032556819906e4163b0017.webm?t=1761962630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457630/extras/e3ad061963032556819906e4163b0017.mp4?t=1761962630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness your enemies weaknesses or just overpower them split your armies between melee and ranged or even baits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your buildings and Dwarves wisely</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which units to keep and upgrade the clearer your vision the faster it will become true.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457630?t=1761962630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storep